Data
----
This repository does not include any dataset files. The back-test uses the
TAWOS dataset. A download script gets it at a fixed version and checks each
file with a checksum. Users get the data from its original source and must
follow its terms. The dataset is cited in the README and CITATION.cff:

- TAWOS: Tawosi, Al-Subaihin, Moussa and Sarro, "A Versatile Dataset of
  Agile Open Source Software Projects", MSR 2022.
